# NEVER commit original game files, binaries, assets or decompiled code.
*.exe
*.dll
*.asi
*.pdb
*.lib
*.obj
*.gr2
*.GR2
*.dds
*.DDS
*.tga
*.bmp
*.bik
*.mp3
*.wav
*.s2m
*.s2c
*.sh2
*.aic
*.bdg
*.uni
*.aml
*.gdp
*.mms
*.mma
*.csc
*.cab
*.dat
# Ghidra databases / exports (may contain decompiled code)
*.gpr
*.rep/
*.gzf
ghidra/
decomp/
# Measurement raw data stays local (summaries go to docs/EXPERIMENTS.md)
captures/
*.csv
*.etl
*.rdc
# Build output
build/
out/
.vs/
__pycache__/
# Silver layer: rebuildable databases (python -I tools/sym.py build)
*.db
# Silver summaries are re-derived from bronze by `ingest.py rebuild --write` (D012); data/index.jsonl and
# data/annotations/ (user facts) stay tracked
data/silver/
# runtime file of the ingest write lock (an OS lock on it; the file itself is harmless)
data/.sh2perf.lock
